231	/**
232	 * @brief Safely executes a function, capturing and setting any exceptions that arise.
233	 *
234	 * This function acts as a wrapper to safely execute a given function or lambda (`fn`).
235	 * If the function throws any exception, the exception is captured, and the error status is
